    "regulatoryStatus": "Not verified in reviewed sources. [150, 151, 152]",
    "limitations": "Evidence was restricted to the three supplied records. The studies were short and small, focused on men undergoing prostate evaluation or surgery, and used different formulations, including lycopene alone, tomato oleoresin, and tomato extract combinations. Long-term clinical outcomes and general-population effects were not verified in the reviewed sources. [150] [150] [150] [150] [150] [150] [151] [151] [151] [152] [152] [152] [152]",
