    "limitations": "The audit is limited to the three supplied records and their summaries. Adverse events were not reported in the reviewed summaries; the McCune record's treatment duration was not reported; and no conclusions were transferred to other lysine formulations, analogs, indications, or records. [183] [183] [183]",
