    "regulatoryStatus": "Not verified in reviewed sources. [204, 205, 206]",
    "limitations": "The audit reviewed exactly three supplied records. Two were eligible primary human outcome studies and one was a protocol with no results. Evidence is limited by small samples, narrow populations, short durations, attrition/noncompliance in the arthralgia trial, and the pilot nature of the metabolic-syndrome trial. Formulation-specific evidence should not be transferred across tart cherry concentrate and tart cherry juice. [204] [205] [205]",
