    "canonicalName": "Colostrum (primarily bovine colostrum; evidence kept formulation-specific) [228, 229, 230]",
    "aliases": "Colostrum; bovine colostrum; bovine colostrum protein concentrate/fraction (formulation-specific) [228, 229, 230]",
