    "limitations": "Only the three supplied records were reviewed. Two records were counted as eligible primary human studies; the pulmonary-fibrosis record was excluded because it evaluated different branded systemic enzyme formulations. Comparator information, randomization, and adverse-event details were not transferred or inferred when not reported in the reviewed source. [231] [231, 232, 233]",
    "missingFields": "For the carpal-tunnel study, comparator and randomization were not verified in the reviewed source. For the ankle-sprain study, adverse events were not verified in the reviewed source. Interaction and regulatory information were not reported in the reviewed sources. [231] [231, 232, 233]",
