    "limitations": "Only the three supplied candidate records were reviewed. One record was a systematic review/meta-analysis and was not counted as a primary human study. The two counted studies evaluated different formulations (GCB70® and CGA-7™), so their findings were not pooled or transferred to one another or to unspecified green coffee extract. The reviewed summaries do not provide complete protocol details, comparator information for GCB70®, detailed adverse-event counts, or long-term outcomes. [270] [271] [271]",
