    "safetySummary": "In the osteoporosis study, 76% of treated subjects developed SGOT elevations or other side effects, but these effects were not severe enough to terminate medication. [395] In the postphlebitic-syndrome study, no side effects of consequence were noted at 5 mg twice per day. [397] Safety findings for the geriatric record are not verified in the reviewed source summary.",
