    "safetySummary": "The eligible randomized trial reported nausea in 23.1% versus 50.5% and vomiting in 5.6% versus 18.8% with levonorgestrel versus the Yuzpe regimen, respectively; both were significantly less frequent with levonorgestrel. [588]",
