    "regulatoryStatus": "Not verified in reviewed sources. [657, 658, 659]",
    "limitations": "Three candidate records were reviewed, but the 2026 record is a narrative review rather than a uniquely identifiable primary human outcome study and was not counted. The eligible evidence consists of two different clinical contexts: a preliminary 90-day diabetes pilot and a pediatric malnutrition trial with no significant nutritional-recovery benefit. The first source does not verify a comparator or randomization details; the second does not report an exact dose or supplementation duration in the reviewed source. Findings should not be transferred to other Moringa formulations or analogs. [657] [657] [657] [657] [657] [657]",
    "missingFields": "For the diabetes pilot, comparator and randomization details were not verified in the reviewed source. For the pediatric malnutrition trial, exact dose and supplementation duration were not verified in the reviewed source. Long-term clinical benefits were not verified in the reviewed sources. [657] [657] [657] [657] [657] [657]",
